  1133                              <1> ; ide_identify: BL = drive, CX = ms to wait for a busy drive -> AL = D_*
  1134                              <1> ; (D_OK: the model and the CF badge are on the screen). BX kept.
  1135                              <1> ; IRQ 14 is kept away: the drive's interrupt is off (3F6h nIEN), IRQ 14
  1136                              <1> ; is masked in the slave PIC while the command runs, the status is read
  1137                              <1> ; at the end and 40:8E cleared; the master is selected again at the end.
  1138                              <1> ide_identify:
  1139 0000077D 53                  <1>     push bx
